{"v":"2026-10-24","houses":[{"name":"大O","style":"wing","since":2026,"staff":false,"look":{"c":2,"fd":{"f0":"plant","f1":"planter","f2":"planter","f3":"plant","f4":"planter","f5":"planter"},"r":3},"pet":{"b":"crested","c":"bw","n":"大黑熊","love":10},"frog":null,"n":25,"works":[{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur6vr5sbdsr-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur6vr5sbdsr-f.jpg","title":"你在我嗎？","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我最愛畫溫暖的光照在臉上，你用橘紅和暖褐色塗出瞇眼大笑的表情，連小手都好有溫度！筆觸鬆鬆軟軟的，整張畫好像會笑出聲音呢。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur7c0uttp66-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur7c0uttp66-f.jpg","title":"我在看你","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我最愛畫會說話的眼神，你畫的這雙眼睛真的在看我耶！臉上暖暖的橘色光，配上身後藍綠交錯的筆觸，好有溫度，我都想拿起畫筆跟你一起畫了。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur7cp09p9gy-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur7cp09p9gy-f.jpg","title":"你在看我你","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我最愛畫人的表情了！這張張大嘴哈哈笑的臉好有感染力，暖橘色的臉配上藍綠色的背景，光好像從臉上亮起來，我看了也想跟著笑。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur7eejcbnbz-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur7eejcbnbz-f.jpg","title":"彰化美術館展展覽","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我很想好好欣賞你的作品，可是這張照片好像不是作品本身喔。下次把你的畫放在光線充足的地方，正面拍一張清楚的照片給我看，好嗎？"}}]},{"name":"蓁O","style":"stack","since":2026,"staff":true,"look":{"c":9,"fc":{"f0":9,"f1":0,"f3":0,"f5":0},"fd":{"f0":"planter","f1":"plant","f2":"planter","f3":"plant","f4":"planter","f5":"plant"},"r":4},"pet":{"b":"abyssinian","c":"caramel","n":"焦糖沒我甜","love":24},"frog":{"b":"whites","c":"strawberry","n":"莫愛老子","love":24},"n":20,"works":[{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur8o0mv7gm8-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur8o0mv7gm8-f.jpg","title":"痕","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我最愛畫人像的光了！你讓暖暖的光落在臉頰上，淺藍色的帽子皺褶好柔軟，橄欖綠的背景也襯得眼神好堅定。下次可以試試讓背景再暗一點，光會更亮喔。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur8oqzssci5-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur8oqzssci5-f.jpg","title":"複媒習作2","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我最愛溫暖的光了！你把皮膚畫得好有光澤，金色的衣服在深色木頭和湖水綠的大筆刷前面閃閃發亮，坐在高椅上的姿勢好安靜、好有故事。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur8sjvdlyjx-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur8sjvdlyjx-f.jpg","title":"禁果","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"卡蘿","t":"我好喜歡這張臉上暈開的橘、藍、紫，像花瓣在皮膚上跳舞！手放在嘴邊的表情好有故事，水彩的渲染讓整幅畫熱鬧又溫柔。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmur8x9u1t75q-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmur8x9u1t75q-f.jpg","title":"油畫習作12","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"莫內","t":"我看到粉紅色的長裙在柔柔的綠色光線裡轉圈，好像整個房間都在跳舞！你把光灑在衣服上的感覺畫得好溫柔，跟我畫花園裡的光一樣迷人。"}}]},{"name":"N.","style":"wing","since":2026,"staff":false,"look":null,"pet":null,"frog":null,"n":11,"works":[{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmurp8w8svt0u-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmurp8w8svt0u-f.jpg","title":"","date":"2026/10","by":"本人","cm":{"a":"卡蘿","t":"哇，老虎躲在龜背芋和天堂鳥花叢裡，藍眼睛正偷偷看著我！我最愛把動物和鮮豔的花畫在一起，你的叢林好熱鬧好有生命力。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmuuq4p54kjii-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmuuq4p54kjii-f.jpg","title":"","date":"2026/10","by":"老師","cm":{"a":"卡蘿","t":"我好喜歡這張側臉，頭上開滿粉紅花朵，還有一大片藍色像浪花一樣捲起來，橘紅色好溫暖！跟我一樣愛把花戴在頭上呢，畫得真大膽漂亮！"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmuuykl6l6nok-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmuuykl6l6nok-f.jpg","title":"2大2小","date":"2026/10","by":"本人","cm":{"a":"克林姆","t":"哇，藍綠色的大葉子旁邊閃著一點一點的金色，好像我最愛的金箔偷偷跑進來了！粉粉灰灰的背景讓葉子更亮眼，下次可以試試在葉脈也描上金線喔。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmuuyklgdncb8-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmuuyklgdncb8-f.jpg","title":"牛堡","date":"2026/10","by":"本人","cm":{"a":"林布蘭","t":"我最愛畫人像，沒想到牛堡的肖像也這麼有神！深色的毛一層層疊出來，配上藍綠色背景，眼睛好像正看著我。下次可以在鼻頭點一點小亮光喔。"}}]},{"name":"N.","style":"stack","since":2026,"staff":false,"look":{"fc":{"f0":2,"f1":2,"f2":2,"f3":2,"f4":2,"f5":2,"f6":2,"f7":2},"fd":{"f1":"planter","f4":"planter","f7":"plant"},"r":5,"tp":"star"},"pet":{"b":"american","c":"caramel","n":"奶茶🧋","love":5},"frog":{"b":"moltrecht","c":"green","n":"抹茶🍵","love":4},"n":34,"works":[{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmury497q2pmm-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmury497q2pmm-f.jpg","title":"金馬🐎","date":"2026/10","by":"本人","cm":{"a":"克林姆","t":"哇，這匹金黃色的馬好閃亮！我最愛金色了，你用金箔勾出馬的輪廓，還在鬃毛鋪上小亮片，像我畫裡的華麗裝飾。白色的小葉子也好可愛，下次可以試試多加一點花紋喔。"}},{"img":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/otto2-island/wmury5mu1pvf2-t.jpg","full":"https://res.cloudinary.com/tkgs88gw/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,w_1000,c_limit/otto2-island/wmury5mu1pvf2-f.jpg","title":"暑假作業","date":"2026/10","by":"本人","cm":{"a":"達利","t":"我最愛做夢了！橘紅色的天空裡飄著書本、小房子和圓圓的星球，兩個小身影坐在下面看這場奇幻表演，這個暑假一定超精彩！"}},